  "scope": {
    "zh": "本版24条和四部分均为费马原创自我观察组织，不是临床或发展评估、标准成熟度量表、智力或EQ能力测量；不估心理年龄、脑发育、智者类型、健康、创伤原因、品德、关系质量或职业。研究中的责任、视角和节制等概念只提供背景，三因素研究并不验证本站四部分、题目、均分或解释，也不把特定年龄与司法样本的结果迁移到个体。频率高低受机会、情境、记忆和表述影响，不是能力或人群排名；支持、求助、拒绝和改变约定不等于不成熟。",
    "en": "These twenty-four items and four parts are FermatMind’s original organisation for self-observation, not a clinical or developmental assessment, standard maturity instrument, intelligence test or EQ ability measure. They estimate no mental age, brain development, wise type, health, trauma cause, morality, relationship quality or career. Research concepts such as responsibility, perspective and temperance provide background only: three-factor research validates neither these four parts, items, means nor interpretations, and results from specific age or justice samples are not transferred to individuals. Frequency depends on opportunity, context, recall and wording, not ability or population rank. Receiving support, seeking help, declining and revising agreements establish no immaturity."
  },
  "instructions": {
    "zh": "回想近四周，在出现相关机会时，这种具体做法出现得多频繁。按从不到几乎总是选择；没有相关机会、资料不足或不愿回答，选对应选项，不当零分。24题选完才生成四部分结果；每部分6条至少4条有效评分才显示均分，其他部分可以独立保留。这里不判断你的年龄、好坏或是否足够成熟。",
    "en": "Think about the past four weeks and how often the specific response occurred when there was a relevant opportunity. Choose Never through Almost always. Select the separate option for no relevant opportunity, insufficient information or preferring not to answer; it is not zero. All twenty-four selections are required for a result. Each six-item part needs at least four ratings for its own mean; other parts can remain available independently. This does not judge your age, worth or whether you are mature enough."
